                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October 24,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay states that the consul-general at Barcelona may certify to a copy of the
                    Porto Rican paper, and, if necessary, visé same.]</p>
            </div>
